# welcome-fit-1024x640 (h10-fit): the welcome page shrunk to fit a 1024 x 640
# window (fit 0.71 at density 2), dark Arctic Ice, reduced motion (the hero is
# the still).
route welcome
size 1024 640
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
reduced-motion on
wait 2000
shot welcome-fit-1024x640
